We need to follow exact format. Provide a thought, then action verify_route with route JSON string. Then after verification, if ok, final answer.

Let's construct route JSON string. Ensure double quotes escaped? The tool expects a string argument, so we can pass as normal JSON string; the outer JSON for action_input will have route as string, need to escape quotes. We'll embed as raw string with proper escaping.

Route string:

{
  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "COc1cccc(NC(=O)c2nnn(Cc3ccc(C[NH+]4CC(F)C4)cc3)c2N)c1",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": 84231,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "COc1cccc(NC(=O)c2nnn(Cc3ccc(CCl)cc3)c2N)c1"
        },
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "C[NH+]4CC(F)C4"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

We'll pass as a string. Let's call verify_route.
